WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.446 line:85%
Cohort 7, do you read? This is your commander.

2
00:00:03.466 --> 00:00:05.663 line:85%
Oceanus Procellarum. The Ocean of Storms.

3
00:00:05.683 --> 00:00:07.475 line:85%
There. The Marius Hills skylight.

4
00:00:07.495 --> 00:00:09.554 line:85%
50 m wide. Some 80 m deep.

5
00:00:09.574 --> 00:00:10.940 line:85%
Below it, an intact lava tube.

6
00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:13.267 line:85%
Its roof blocks radiation, micrometeorites and extreme heat.

7
00:00:13.287 --> 00:00:15.008 line:85%
A natural shelter for a future lunar base.

8
00:00:15.028 --> 00:00:16.566 line:85%
But a first rappel on the Moon is too risky.

9
00:00:16.586 --> 00:00:17.938 line:85%
So we rehearse on Earth.

10
00:00:17.958 --> 00:00:19.966 line:85%
Your mission: find the skylight's closest twin on our planet.

11
00:00:19.986 --> 00:00:22.410 line:85%
Scan the terrain, compare the pits, then walk the site in 3D.

12
00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:24.186 line:85%
Which coordinates will you choose, and why?

13
00:00:24.206 --> 00:00:25.200 line:85%
Commander out.
